Coherent project changes

Install:
  Install the bundled skill if needed.

Upgrade:
  Replace the installed skill with the version bundled with Wsley.

Status:
  Report whether the skill is installed and where its files are located.

Requirements:
  A regular user and standard file utilities.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/coherent-change
  On upgrade, an existing copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/coherent-change becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
